## Questions

| Question | Returns | Must NOT return |
|---|---|---|
| attest | alive, clock, blind_check, oldest event | full log / dump |
| sketch | deltas in window | raw lists |
| edges | capped join-keyed hops | whole table |
| explain | what changed in window | whole journal |
| trace | one reconstructed grain | every event |
| hops | per-hop localization | continuous stream |
| fail | timeouts / mismatches / candidates | dumps |
| baseline | p50/p95/p99; n<30 → hole | warehouse |

Rename to domain prefixes (`netattest`, `txntrace`, …). Keep the jobs.

